  "details": "We have x_Stretched, x_Angle, and x_IsGrabbed, but no way to tell which hand actually grabbed the bone. Please add x_HandL and x_HandR to the PhysBone parameters. \n\nUsing contacts, we can *guess* which hand grabbed the bone, but it will fail if both hands are in a contact or if you pull to the side. Having proper parameters would make RP objects holstered to your body much easier to manage and set up for use with both hands.\n\n*it would also make sure this doesn't happen...*\nhttps://youtu.be/on1xg_O8z8c\n\nnakos",
